-- title:
--   The need of the batched counting oracle is polynomially bounded
-- statement:
--   `PolyNeedN oNeed`: there are constants $s,k$ (here $3200$ and $800$) such that for every parameter list $[n,U,s,p]$ the word size, the number of cells and the call depth that the batched counting oracle `oProg` needs (`oNeed`) are each at most `polyBound 3200 800 ps` $=2^{3200}\prod_i(p_i+1)^{800}$.
